{"logId": "7f0b36e7-e90b-46d3-a598-aa642808366b", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [371, 213, 631, 407], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[371.0, 213.0], [631.0, 213.0], [631.0, 407.0], [371.0, 407.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "信仰：公平 自由 快乐 博爱", "block_bbox": [944, 314, 2013, 409], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[944.0, 314.0], [2013.0, 314.0], [2013.0, 409.0], [944.0, 409.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "使命：创造快乐、分享快乐、传播快乐", "block_bbox": [1066, 452, 1889, 515], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[1066.0, 452.0], [1889.0, 452.0], [1889.0, 515.0], [1066.0, 515.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "基本要求：爱心、坦诚、勤奋、专业、感恩，遇事抱吃亏态度、不急功近利", "block_bbox": [684, 554, 2273, 617], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[684.0, 554.0], [2273.0, 554.0], [2273.0, 617.0], [684.0, 617.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "要从一点一滴的小事做起，用心说话，用心做事", "block_bbox": [923, 667, 1939, 731], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[923.0, 667.0], [1939.0, 667.0], [1939.0, 731.0], [923.0, 731.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "胖东来企业文化", "block_bbox": [1026, 866, 1885, 998], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[1026.0, 866.0], [1885.0, 866.0], [1885.0, 998.0], [1026.0, 998.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "指导手册", "block_bbox": [1221, 1086, 1692, 1199], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[1221.0, 1086.0], [1692.0, 1086.0], [1692.0, 1199.0], [1221.0, 1199.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "备注：这本手册会随着企业的成长，始终坚持所制定的政策和标准，不脱离为人服务的原则，不断地完善。肯定每个过程都存在着很多的不足，只要我们坚定信仰，体现我们的信心和意志，一切都会越来越好。每个人都要学会主宰自己的人生，用智慧和能力谱写更加美好的明天，使有限的生命更充实、更真实、更有意义、更有价值，使自己个性和潜能优秀的方面充分地体现和展示，为人类的发展奉献自己的才华，这样也无愧于生命的意义！相信更多的人会成为美的使者，会成为爱的传播者！这样美丽和浪漫会永远和你常伴！（细则的基本要求一定要具备，否则你将不能成为一个合格的胖东来人）", "block_bbox": [327, 1374, 2624, 1742], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[327.0, 1374.0], [2624.0, 1374.0], [2624.0, 1742.0], [327.0, 1742.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "—— 于东来", "block_bbox": [2217, 1758, 2493, 1814], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[2217.0, 1758.0], [2493.0, 1758.0], [2493.0, 1814.0], [2217.0, 1814.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.669102132320404, "coordinate": [371, 213, 631, 407], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[371.0, 213.0], [631.0, 213.0], [631.0, 407.0], [371.0, 407.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8470166325569153, "coordinate": [944, 314, 2013, 409], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[944.0, 314.0], [2013.0, 314.0], [2013.0, 409.0], [944.0, 409.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8478868007659912, "coordinate": [1066, 452, 1889, 515], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[1066.0, 452.0], [1889.0, 452.0], [1889.0, 515.0], [1066.0, 515.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8402057886123657, "coordinate": [684, 554, 2273, 617], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[684.0, 554.0], [2273.0, 554.0], [2273.0, 617.0], [684.0, 617.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8447532653808594, "coordinate": [923, 667, 1939, 731], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[923.0, 667.0], [1939.0, 667.0], [1939.0, 731.0], [923.0, 731.0